      "writtenOn": "2026-06-09T19:14:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is only used for sorting, right?  I\u0027m thinking we could almost sort the EmbeddedImage vector directly, except for `bitCount`... we could query the codec with SkEncodedInfo::getColorDepth, but I\u0027m not sure that it reflects the original bit depth necessarily.\n\nNo actionable suggestion, just bringing it up in case you think there\u0027s a way to make it work.",
